{
  "_comment": [
    "MCVS Offline gamer tags: the names of the generated leaderboard rivals and of the in-match bots (docs/LIVEOPS.md section 'Rival",
    "names and emblems'). Our own word lists, styles and blocklist. tools/content-gen/content_gen.py build_names checks every part",
    "(charset, length, blocklist, no duplicates), checks every two-part combination of every style against the blocklist, counts",
    "the combinations and writes server/Content/names.json with the rivals' emblem and background pools (ids only, from",
    "Design/MCVS_Meta.xlsx). The server (server/Core/Names/GamerTags.cs) builds a name from a style and its parts with hashes of",
    "the player's id, so a rival keeps its name; it applies the same limits and blocklist to every name it makes.",
    "Rules for new words: generic gaming, military, animal, colour, weather and sci-fi words; no first names, no surnames, no",
    "real people, no celebrities, streamers or pro players, no brands, no other games' or films' characters, nothing sexual,",
    "religious, political or about drugs, nothing that insults people. Non-English words romanised to plain ASCII letters.",
    "A word goes in adj or in noun, never both (nounNoun makes ShadowWolf). Two harmless words can make a brand, a streamer,",
    "a character or slang (BlueYeti, SniperWolf, HollowKnight): after adding words, read the list content_gen.py --name-pairs",
    "writes and put what you find in blocklist.substrings."
  ],
  "version": 1,
  "_limits": "the game's own rename popup takes 16 characters (popups/PopupChangeName.as maxChars) and needs 2 (PlayerProfileComponent MinimalPlayerNameLength); the default name agent-<9 digits> has 15",
  "limits": {"min": 3, "max": 16},
  "_years": "the {year} token",
  "years": [1990, 2012],
  "_minCombinations": "build_names fails when the styles give fewer distinct names than this (word parts only, digits not counted)",
  "minCombinations": 50000,
  "_defaultShare": "per cent of rivals that keep the starting emblem and background (StartingKillSignature Avatar=1, Background=1), as an uncustomised player does",
  "defaultShare": 8,
  "_roughNouns": [
    "parts.mascot is the only word list a style may put next to a country code ({country}): animals, sky and landscape words.",
    "A criminal, a fighter, a weapon or a disaster next to a country reads as a national stereotype (Bandit_MX, Pirate_ID,",
    "Tsunami_JP); build_names refuses these words in parts.mascot and refuses {country} with any list but mascot and foreign."
  ],
